{"2492040": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "FATAL FURY: City of the Wolves", "steam_appid": 2492040, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4071070, 4070950, 3141980, 4741370, 4741360, 4741350, 4741340, 4741330, 4741320, 4741310, 4741300, 4741290, 4741280], "detailed_description": "<h1>Revenge Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* This DLC is also included in a separate product (FATAL FURY: CotW - Season Pass 1). Please be careful not to make duplicate purchases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* This DLC is also included in a separate product (FATAL FURY: CotW - Season Pass 2). Please be careful not to make duplicate purchases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* This DLC is also included in a separate product (FATAL FURY: CotW - Season Pass 3). Please be careful not to make duplicate purchases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Some content in this bundle is also available for individual sale. Please be careful not to make duplicate purchases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492040/extras/ea7bb6ba8b93a191031d382ac4853b75.avif?t=1784859139\" width=512 height=288 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><br>Contents</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Base game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Season Pass 1</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Andy Bogard</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Ken, additional stage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Joe Higashi</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Chun-Li</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Mr. Big, additional stage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Season Pass 2</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Kim Jae Hoon, additional stage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Nightmare Geese</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Blue Mary, additional stage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Wolfgang Krauser, additional stage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Mr. Karate, additional stage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Kenshiro, additional stage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Season Pass 3</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- DLC Character 1 &quot;Rick Strowd&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- DLC Character 2 &quot;Duck King&quot; (August 2026)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- DLC Character 3 &quot;Kim Kaphwan&quot; (September 2026)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- DLC Character 4 &quot;???&quot; (October 2026)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- DLC Character 5 &quot;Laocorn&quot; (November 2026)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- DLC Character 6 &quot;???&quot; (December 2026)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Additional stages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Release date estimates are current at the time of publication.</p></p><br><h1>Legend Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Base game, Season Pass 1 and Season Pass 2 is also available for individual purchase. Make sure you have the correct product at checkout. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492040/extras/a87454d603153669e54e9bfff2e38ad6.poster.avif?t=1784859139\" width=512 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492040/extras/a87454d603153669e54e9bfff2e38ad6.webm?t=1784859139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492040/extras/a87454d603153669e54e9bfff2e38ad6.mp4?t=1784859139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Contents</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Base game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Season Pass 1</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-DLC  Andy Bogard<br>-DLC  Ken, Additional Stage<br>-DLC  Joe Higashi<br>-DLC  Chun-Li<br>-DLC  Mr. Big, Additional stage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Season Pass 2</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- DLC Kim Jae Hoon, Additional stage<br>- DLC Nightmare Geese<br>- DLC Character 3 &quot;Blue Mary&quot;, Additional stage<br>- DLC Character 4 &quot;Wolfgang Krauser&quot;, Additional stage <br>- DLC Character 5 &quot;Mr. Karate&quot;, Additional stage <br>- DLC Character 6 &quot;Kenshiro&quot;, Additional stage </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Release date estimates are current at the time of publication.</p></p><br><h1>Standard Edition</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492040/extras/bb49c5bb235a23913640d6cd0d24b047.avif?t=1784859139\" width=512 height=286 /></span><br>Contents</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Base game</strong><br><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SNK’s beloved Fatal Fury series first hit the market in 1991, spearheading the fighting game boom of the 1990s that swept the industry thereafter. GAROU: MARK OF THE WOLVES (released in 1999) has, for some time, served as the franchise’s most recent installment. But that is all about to change: 26 years on, a brand-new entry—FATAL FURY: City of the Wolves—is set to arrive on the scene!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492040/extras/b45388a9954421141e3a356ba7348708.poster.avif?t=1784859139\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492040/extras/b45388a9954421141e3a356ba7348708.webm?t=1784859139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492040/extras/b45388a9954421141e3a356ba7348708.mp4?t=1784859139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SNK’s beloved Fatal Fury series first hit the market in 1991, spearheading the fighting game boom of the 1990s that swept the industry thereafter. GAROU: MARK OF THE WOLVES (released in 1999) has, for some time, served as the franchise’s most recent installment. But that is all about to change: 26 years on, a brand-new entry—FATAL FURY: City of the Wolves—is set to arrive on the scene!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■All-new REV System supercharges the excitement!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Introducing the REV System, a brand-new toolset that offers unique offensive options from the moment the battle begins! Use REV Arts, REV Accel, REV Blows (while S.P.G. is active), and more until you hit your limit and the REV Meter overheats. The all-new REV System—fight at full throttle and supercharge the excitement! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■Two control schemes—fun for newcomers and veterans alike!<br>Choose from two control schemes: Arcade Style is based on precise, technical inputs, while Smart Style lets you perform flashy special moves and combos using directional inputs and single button presses. From fighting game newcomers to seasoned veterans, there’s plenty of fun and excitement to be had—tailored specifically to your level! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492040/extras/bb49c5bb235a23913640d6cd0d24b047.avif?t=1784859139\" width=512 height=286 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■Strive for supremacy in EPISODES OF SOUTH TOWN, a single-player RPG mode!<br>Introducing “Episodes of South Town” (EOST)—a solo RPG adventure where you’ll square up against contenders under various fight conditions, earning XP and other rewards for your efforts. Level up your fighter, build out a diverse kit of skills, and dominate the opposition on your way to the top. Dreams and ambitions run rampant in South Town; now is the time to chase the city’s crown and carve a legend all of your own!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* To play EOST you’ll first need to connect to the Internet and update the game.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492040/extras/6b40b8966668869583ddfbb203681693.avif?t=1784859139\" width=512 height=286 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492040/extras/b45388a9954421141e3a356ba7348708.poster.avif?t=1784859139\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492040/extras/b45388a9954421141e3a356ba7348708.webm?t=1784859139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492040/extras/b45388a9954421141e3a356ba7348708.mp4?t=1784859139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SNK’s beloved Fatal Fury series first hit the market in 1991, spearheading the fighting game boom of the 1990s that swept the industry thereafter. GAROU: MARK OF THE WOLVES (released in 1999) has, for some time, served as the franchise’s most recent installment. But that is all about to change: 26 years on, a brand-new entry—FATAL FURY: City of the Wolves—is set to arrive on the scene!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■All-new REV System supercharges the excitement!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Introducing the REV System, a brand-new toolset that offers unique offensive options from the moment the battle begins! Use REV Arts, REV Accel, REV Blows (while S.P.G. is active), and more until you hit your limit and the REV Meter overheats. The all-new REV System—fight at full throttle and supercharge the excitement! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■Two control schemes—fun for newcomers and veterans alike!<br>Choose from two control schemes: Arcade Style is based on precise, technical inputs, while Smart Style lets you perform flashy special moves and combos using directional inputs and single button presses. From fighting game newcomers to seasoned veterans, there’s plenty of fun and excitement to be had—tailored specifically to your level! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492040/extras/bb49c5bb235a23913640d6cd0d24b047.avif?t=1784859139\" width=512 height=286 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■Strive for supremacy in EPISODES OF SOUTH TOWN, a single-player RPG mode!<br>Introducing “Episodes of South Town” (EOST)—a solo RPG adventure where you’ll square up against contenders under various fight conditions, earning XP and other rewards for your efforts. Level up your fighter, build out a diverse kit of skills, and dominate the opposition on your way to the top. Dreams and ambitions run rampant in South Town; now is the time to chase the city’s crown and carve a legend all of your own!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* To play EOST you’ll first need to connect to the Internet and update the game.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492040/extras/6b40b8966668869583ddfbb203681693.avif?t=1784859139\" width=512 height=286 /></span></p>", "short_description": "26 years on, a brand-new entry in the Fatal Fury series is set to arrive on the scene! FATAL FURY: City of the Wolves features a unique art style that stimulates the senses and an innovative REV System that supercharges the excitement. Here, at long last, a new legend is about to unfold…", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabi